# "Island" in Spreading Seas's "Enchanted land is an Island" is a basic land type word (CR 612.2). Magical Hack replaces it
# with Swamp in the Aura's text (CR 612.1, layer 3): the Aura now sets the enchanted land's subtype to Swamp (CR 305.7, layer
# 4), so Bot2's Mutavault is a Swamp that taps for {B} - not an Island, and not a Mutavault with its own abilities.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Spreading Seas
Magical Hack
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Mutavault
Plains x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mutavault.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Spreading Seas.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Mutavault)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Mutavault.Subtypes = Island
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Magical Hack.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Spreading Seas)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Modes(Island)
Bot1.Modes(Swamp)
[T6 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Battlefield.Mutavault.Activate
? Bot2.Mana = {B}

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Mutavault.Subtypes = Swamp
Bot1.Graveyard = Magical Hack
